e=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a8" target="g1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e28" value="loop: no more gauges" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a8" target="e"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="note" value="Rationale: automating this path removes the officer from the time-critical loop and gives downstream districts 1–2 h of lead time. The confidence gate (≥ 0.75) and the 30-min per-(gauge, alert_level) de-duplication window keep alert fatigue low." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;size=14;align=left;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="120" width="715" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>